        "links": [],
        "paragraphs": [
          "Step up to the upper-level living areas, which have windows on three sides, maximizing natural light and garden views.  The ground floor—three units with polished timber floors and the other one with terrazzo tiles—houses a queen-sized canopied bed and a bathroom complete with a handmade terrazzo tub, big enough for two. ",
          "Exposed brick, a quirky stone relief, and the antique carved wooden door and windows visually enrich the veranda, which frames a serene private garden. "
