        "paragraphs": [
          "The façade reflects the beauty of traditional Balinese architecture, set within a flourishing beachside courtyard, while the hardwood and bamboo materials deepen your connection to nature. You enter the ground-floor bedroom—one bungalow with a wooden floor and the other with terracotta tile—through an antique Balinese doorway. ",
          "The ground floor also features an indoor bathroom and an outdoor shower.  Ascend the spiral staircase to the upper level, where you’ll feel embraced by the treetops. The classic veranda invites you to unwind and enjoy the sights and sounds of the seaside garden."
        ]
