        "items": [
          "2 Adults",
          "128 m²"
        ],
        "links": [],
        "paragraphs": [
          " Two bungalows boast thatched roofs adorned with blue batik tiles and outdoor bathtubs, while the others feature wood shingle roofs complemented by green celadon batik tiles and indoor bathtubs. Stroll through the gardens and discover the traditionally proportioned veranda, graced with carved wooden pillars, a kamasan painting, and carefully curated antique windows and doors—each element profoundly telling a story of the Tandjung Sari experience. ",
          "Inside, spacious bedrooms welcome you with a canopied queen bed, a generous work table and a daybed, ideal for reading. Each bungalow offers a decent bathroom and dressing area, equipped with twin vanity sinks, double wardrobe closets, and an indoor shower with seating. Step beyond the door to uncover an outdoor shower with a refreshing rain showerhead."
        ]
      },
